{"path":"/2021/03/keptos-darzoves-terikiaki-padaze.html","kind":"article","title":"Keptos daržovės teriaki padaže (#PenktadienioReceptai)","description":"Laikas: Apie 20 min. Kaina: Nedidelė Jums reikės: 0,5 baklažano 0,5 cukinijos (arba viena maža) 0,5 brokolio 1 didelė morka 2 raudoni...","published":"2021-03-24T22:45:00+02:00","section":"Tikėjimas ir kultūra","labels":["pasninkas","PenktadienioReceptai"],"hero":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411105348im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-1o1kwhC6b6w/X_MYMDCDCHI/AAAAAAABE1s/kxirwCnpNrkwYafFkPyqEPXyIHJJKf7ggCPcBGAsYHg/w1200-h630-p-k-no-nu/IMG_20210103_151511%257E2.jpg","html":"<p>&nbsp;</p><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-1o1kwhC6b6w/X_MYMDCDCHI/AAAAAAABE1s/kxirwCnpNrkwYafFkPyqEPXyIHJJKf7ggCPcBGAsYHg/s3120/IMG_20210103_151511%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411105348im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-1o1kwhC6b6w/X_MYMDCDCHI/AAAAAAABE1s/kxirwCnpNrkwYafFkPyqEPXyIHJJKf7ggCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210103_151511%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div><b>Laikas:&nbsp;</b>Apie<b>&nbsp;</b>20 min.</div><div><p><b>Kaina:&nbsp;</b>Nedidelė&nbsp;</p><p><b><br></b></p><p><b>Jums reikės:</b></p></div>0,5 baklažano<div>0,5 cukinijos (arba viena maža)</div><div>0,5 brokolio</div><div>1 didelė morka</div><div>2 raudonieji svogūnai</div><div>1 paprika</div><div>Aliejus</div><div><br></div><div><b>Padažas</b></div><div>6 šaukštai nesuraus sojos padažo&nbsp;</div><div>2 šaukštai sezamo aliejaus</div><div>~0,5 šaukštelio imbiero (šviežio arba prieskonių pavidalu)</div><div>3 česnako galvutės</div><div>2 šaukšteliai cukraus&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>2 šaukštai kukurūzų miltų,&nbsp;</div><div>2 šaukštai vandens<br><p></p><p><br></p><p><b>Paruošimas:</b></p><p>1. Pjaustome visas daržoves stambiais gabaliukais.&nbsp;</p><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-RSxmkQfifEk/X_MYTOQtzjI/AAAAAAABE1w/M-HUh2_6x_QaNMQ5EaJ7gQUrAILuuuCUwCPcBGAsYHg/s3927/IMG_20210103_142802%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411105348im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-RSxmkQfifEk/X_MYTOQtzjI/AAAAAAABE1w/M-HUh2_6x_QaNMQ5EaJ7gQUrAILuuuCUwCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210103_142802%257E2.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><div><br></div><div>Iš paprikos reikia išimti sėklas.</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-QIFO0exzu_Y/X_MYeBXCpHI/AAAAAAABE10/e2VJK2jWvZ8wY7VmDKSu-bVBVZs9ATRqgCPcBGAsYHg/s2407/IMG_20210103_143454%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411105348im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-QIFO0exzu_Y/X_MYeBXCpHI/AAAAAAABE10/e2VJK2jWvZ8wY7VmDKSu-bVBVZs9ATRqgCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210103_143454%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-zqi_yD5yNI4/X_MYtkUxRQI/AAAAAAABE14/rZ6c1rWXy5AjE5HEnn6nJGLK76JHN89_ACPcBGAsYHg/s2066/IMG_20210103_143638%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411105348im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-zqi_yD5yNI4/X_MYtkUxRQI/AAAAAAABE14/rZ6c1rWXy5AjE5HEnn6nJGLK76JHN89_ACPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210103_143638%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-pT95MVVlKCo/X_MY3XRvSDI/AAAAAAABE2A/SucfxfEafRst4LUiCxgC91JJOWTZpC3KACPcBGAsYHg/s2322/IMG_20210103_143745%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411105348im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-pT95MVVlKCo/X_MY3XRvSDI/AAAAAAABE2A/SucfxfEafRst4LUiCxgC91JJOWTZpC3KACPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210103_143745%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div>2. Kepame keptuvėje, įkaitintame aliejuje</div><div><br></div><div><div>3. Padažas: įpilame sojų padažą ir sezamo aliejų, česnako galvutes sutriname ir įdedame, imbierą įdedame smulkiai sutarkavę. Jo dydis kaip maždaug tų trijų česnako galvučių. Įdedame sukraus, sumaišome</div></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-BQCgSrG5TXo/X_MY_NI1JKI/AAAAAAABE2E/HrevhfCSGfcsWqfFjm_nT4OQDGIRNu9XwCPcBGAsYHg/s2852/IMG_20210103_144937%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411105348im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-BQCgSrG5TXo/X_MY_NI1JKI/AAAAAAABE2E/HrevhfCSGfcsWqfFjm_nT4OQDGIRNu9XwCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210103_144937%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div>4. Kukurūzų miltus sumaišome su vandeniu 1:1</div><div><br></div><div>5. Daržovėms apkepus, supilame padažą, užvažiaviame daržoves, kad jos pasitroškintų padaže.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-6AWR3J6vqvA/X_MZEYigsqI/AAAAAAABE2I/0kx9s-3FYJoxXcc-8cwIN_uJLG_FUumMwCPcBGAsYHg/s2664/IMG_20210103_150813%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411105348im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-6AWR3J6vqvA/X_MZEYigsqI/AAAAAAABE2I/0kx9s-3FYJoxXcc-8cwIN_uJLG_FUumMwCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210103_150813%257E2.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><div>6. Į keptuvę supilame kukurūzų mišinį. Jis sutirština padažą. Dar kiek pakepę, patiekiame su ryžiais. Galima dėti daržoves tiesiai ant ryžių, kad susigertų padažas.</div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-KgaeYa-GcYE/X_MZKFIoXTI/AAAAAAABE2M/LKj3fofqeaEwa78TaFxqJLj0yjPrwSk2QCPcBGAsYHg/s3120/IMG_20210103_151511%257E2.jpg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210411105348im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-KgaeYa-GcYE/X_MZKFIoXTI/AAAAAAABE2M/LKj3fofqeaEwa78TaFxqJLj0yjPrwSk2QCPcBGAsYHg/s320/IMG_20210103_151511%257E2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><br></div></div>","capture":"20210411105348","source":"http://www.ortodoksas.lt/2021/03/keptos-darzoves-terikiaki-padaze.html"}
